{"4731830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nahualli", "steam_appid": 4731830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731830/extras/f201743edef6f5e6cf37b87048cd1259.avif?t=1788309939\" width=1000 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nahualli is a multiplayer prop hunt game set inside a vibrant Mexican mercado, where nothing is what it seems. Blend in among piñatas, flower pots, cuts of meat, and bowls of salsa — or stalk the aisles hunting for the impostor among the merchandise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this isn't your typical prop hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731830/extras/55ddd2b67ee04e6e355c95ce0bfead34.poster.avif?t=1788309939\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731830/extras/55ddd2b67ee04e6e355c95ce0bfead34.webm?t=1788309939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731830/extras/55ddd2b67ee04e6e355c95ce0bfead34.mp4?t=1788309939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731830/extras/b45f94c4d3a7177b95847226c518729a.avif?t=1788309939\" width=1000 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the timer runs out, any surviving Nahualli players don't just win — they <strong>transform</strong>. Inspired by Mexican folklore, these shape-shifters shed their disguises and become massive, terrifying werewolf-like creatures called Nahuals. The hunters are now the prey, scrambling to survive in the same market that moments ago felt safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match plays in two acts: comedy turns to chaos, laughter turns to screaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731830/extras/525d21fb58f1338f836c643bb3cf4bf2.poster.avif?t=1788309939\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731830/extras/525d21fb58f1338f836c643bb3cf4bf2.webm?t=1788309939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731830/extras/525d21fb58f1338f836c643bb3cf4bf2.mp4?t=1788309939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731830/extras/95706f8c75fe5ddd361d7ac157efca02.avif?t=1788309939\" width=1000 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Two-Phase Gameplay</i></strong><i> — Rounds start as a lighthearted prop hunt and escalate into a frantic survival horror chase when the Nahuallis transform.</i> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mexican Mercado Like No Other</strong> — Hide among dozens of authentic props across flower stalls, butcher shops, fruit stands, taco restaurants, and more — all dripping with cultural detail. (With future maps coming soon after initial launch)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>2-8 Players</i></strong><i> — Perfect for quick sessions with friends or chaotic full lobbies.</i> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rooted in Folklore</strong> — The Nahualli draws from real Mesoamerican legends of shape-shifters who walk among us in disguise. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731830/extras/aa7916493bc6cc48b0bda80695f91723.avif?t=1788309939\" width=1000 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nahualli launches with one fully realized mercado map packed with hiding spots and atmosphere. During Early Access, we plan to add:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>4 additional maps with new environments and props</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Community-driven balance updates</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quality of life improvements based on player feedback</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731830/extras/fed92e3f1fad733da23246b2e66c5c4f.poster.avif?t=1788309939\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731830/extras/fed92e3f1fad733da23246b2e66c5c4f.webm?t=1788309939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731830/extras/fed92e3f1fad733da23246b2e66c5c4f.mp4?t=1788309939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your feedback shapes the future of Nahualli. Come be part of the hunt.</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731830/extras/f201743edef6f5e6cf37b87048cd1259.avif?t=1788309939\" width=1000 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nahualli is a multiplayer prop hunt game set inside a vibrant Mexican mercado, where nothing is what it seems. Blend in among piñatas, flower pots, cuts of meat, and bowls of salsa — or stalk the aisles hunting fo